<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Erro interno · DARK BOT</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css" />
  <style>
    body{font-family:monospace;background:#0a0a0a;color:#e5e5e5;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:100vh;margin:0}
    .box{text-align:center;padding:2.5rem;border:1px solid #ef4444;border-radius:12px;max-width:560px;background:#111}
    h1{color:#ef4444;margin:0 0 1rem;font-size:1.4rem}
    .det{margin-top:1.25rem;text-align:left;background:#0d0d0d;border:1px solid #333;border-radius:8px;padding:1rem;font-size:.78rem;color:#fca5a5;white-space:pre-wrap;word-break:break-word}
    .muted{color:#777;font-size:.85rem;margin-top:1.2rem}
    a{color:#8B5CF6}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="box">
    <h1>🕸️ Erro interno do servidor</h1>
    <p>Algo falhou nesta página — mas o bot continua vivo.</p>
    <p class="muted">Tenta de novo em segundos. Se persistir, o Dono pode ver a causa abaixo<br>(também aparece no painel <a href="/dashboard/console">Consola</a>).</p>
    <% if (typeof detalhe !== 'undefined' && detalhe) { %>
      <div class="det"><%= detalhe %></div>
    <% } %>
    <p class="muted"><a href="/dashboard">← Voltar ao dashboard</a></p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
